to improve humor; The creature appeared to present defects in its creation, being subsequently discarded from the lin\e, and having a random id created by an employee for reprocessing and rebuilding, however, in an undisclosed manner, the entity managed to exit its assembly facility; The space inside the creature is relatively unknown, with the little available info of i\t being related to the interior of its soul and it having a contradictorily endless size.)/DA(0 0 0 RG 0 0 0 rg /Arial 10 Tf)/DS(font: Arial,sans-serif 10.0pt; text-align:left; color:#000000 )/F 4/M(D:20240918145159-03'00')/NM(d7acb930cdb148c288da8a71ac95f1c3)/Page 1/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:24.3.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:10.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:norma\l;font-family:Arial;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="text-align:justify">Alleging being created by the Italian children entertainment company named &#8220;Mano Della Luna&#8221; \(no registry found in any database of this reality\), Marumarg\pagrinforslebjitza claims to be from a line of toys called &#8220;Sogno Borses \(Dream Bags\)&#8221;, created with the goal of capturing and filtering dreams with its vertical zipper bags to better sleep quality, and also keep a common plush appeal to imp\rove humor; The creature appeared to present defects in its creation, being subsequently discarded from the line, and having a random id created by an employee for reprocessing and rebuilding, however, in an undisclosed manner, the entity managed to exit \its assembly facility; The space inside the creature is relatively unknown, with the little available info of it being related to the interior of its soul and it having a contradictorily endless size.</span></p></body>)/Rect[45.3301 100.864 571.332 206.874]/Subj(Text Box)/Subtype/FreeText/T( )/Type/Annot>>endobj87 0 obj<